---
// Hand-off to the Woman Excel Conference. The conference keeps its own navy /
// pink identity, so this card deliberately uses those tokens rather than the
// fellowship palette.
---

<section class="cew-section">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-navy text-white overflow-hidden grid lg:grid-cols-2 items-center gap-8 lg:gap-0">
        <div class="bg-white/95 flex items-center justify-center p-8 md:p-12 h-full">
            <img class="w-full max-w-sm" src="/images/logo-full.png" alt="The Woman Excel International Conference" loading="lazy" />
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-8 md:p-12">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 md:gap-4">
                <span class="h-px w-10 md:w-16 bg-pink shrink-0"></span>
                <p class="font-sans uppercase text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.25em] text-pink">Our Annual Gathering</p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl text-balance">The Woman Excel Conference</h2>

            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 text-pretty">
                Once a year we open our doors wider. Women from every walk of life come together to worship,
                to sit under powerful teaching, and to be reminded Whose they are. In 2026 we are anchoring
                everything in the Word.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-2">
                <a
                    class="inline-block font-sans text-sm md:text-base rounded-full bg-pink text-white px-7 py-3 transition-colors hover:bg-pink/80"
                    href="/conference/2026"
                >Explore the 2026 Conference</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
